.TH EASE_OUT_BOUNCE 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
ease_out_bounce \- Arrives and bounces a few times before resting, like a dropped ball
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtween.h\(dq
.BI "float ease_out_bounce(float t);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Arrives and bounces a few times before resting, like a dropped ball. Coins landing, letters dropping into a title.
.SH RETURN VALUE
the eased value.
.SH MODULE
tween (src/engine/tween/tween.h)
